z. “May God, who keeps you safe under His wings, bless you.”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":10.55,"words":[{"w":"Why","s":0.625,"e":0.787},{"w":"are","s":0.787,"e":0.875},{"w":"you","s":0.875,"e":1.012},{"w":"so","s":1.012,"e":1.238},{"w":"kind","s":1.238,"e":1.55},{"w":"to","s":1.55,"e":1.637},{"w":"me","s":1.637,"e":1.975},{"w":"asked","s":2.15,"e":2.475},{"w":"Ruth","s":2.475,"e":3.2},{"w":"I","s":3.425,"e":3.575},{"w":"heard","s":3.575,"e":3.825},{"w":"how","s":3.825,"e":4},{"w":"you","s":4,"e":4.125},{"w":"took","s":4.125,"e":4.325},{"w":"care","s":4.325,"e":4.562},{"w":"of","s":4.562,"e":4.65},{"w":"Naomi","s":4.65,"e":5.375},{"w":"said","s":5.525,"e":5.775},{"w":"Boaz","s":5.775,"e":6.55},{"w":"May","s":6.8,"e":7},{"w":"God","s":7,"e":7.425},{"w":"who","s":7.463,"e":7.575},{"w":"keeps","s":7.575,"e":7.838},{"w":"you","s":7.838,"e":7.963},{"w":"safe","s":7.963,"e":8.262},{"w":"under","s":8.262,"e":8.438},{"w":"His","s":8.438,"e":8.637},{"w":"wings","s":8.637,"e":9.025},{"w":"bless","s":9.075,"e":9.412},{"w":"you","s":9.412,"e":9.925}]},"handfuls-title":{"src":"audio/ruth/handfuls-title.m4a","text":"Part Three. Handfuls on Purpose.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.675,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.887},{"w":"Three","s":0.887,"e":1.35},{"w":"Handfuls","s":1.488,"e":2.062},{"w":"on","s":2.062,"e":2.2},{"w":"Purpose","s":2.2,"e":3.075}]},"handfuls-0":{"src":"audio/ruth/handfuls-0.m4a","text":"At lunchtime, Boaz shared his bread with Ruth. She ate until she was full, and she even saved some for Naomi.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.275,"words":[{"w":"At","s":0.6,"e":0.75},{"w":"lunchtime","s":0.75,"e":1.525},{"w":"Boaz","s":1.637,"e":2.038},{"w":"shared","s":2.038,"e":2.312},{"w":"his","s":2.312,"e":2.487},{"w":"bread","s":2.487,"e":2.763},{"w":"with","s":2.763,"e":2.938},{"w":"Ruth","s":2.938,"e":3.725},{"w":"She","s":3.9,"e":4.1},{"w":"ate","s":4.1,"e":4.287},{"w":"until","s":4.287,"e":4.55},{"w":"she","s":4.55,"e":4.688},{"w":"was","s":4.688,"e":4.888},{"w":"full","s":4.888,"e":5.425},{"w":"and","s":5.5,"e":5.625},{"w":"she","s":5.625,"e":5.775},{"w":"even","s":5.775,"e":6.088},{"w":"saved","s":6.088,"e":6.475},{"w":"some","s":6.475,"e":6.7},{"w":"for","s":6.7,"e":6.825},{"w":"Naomi","s":6.825,"e":7.7}]},"handfuls-1":{"src":"audio/ruth/handfuls-1.m4a","text":"Then Boaz told his workers a secret: “Pull out some barley and drop it on purpose, so Ruth can pick it up!”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8,"words":[{"w":"Then","s":0.625,"e":0.838},{"w":"Boaz","s":0.838,"e":1.275},{"w":"told","s":1.275,"e":1.538},{"w":"his","s":1.538,"e":1.7},{"w":"workers","s":1.7,"e":2.1},{"w":"a","s":2.1,"e":2.212},{"w":"secret","s":2.212,"e":3.075},{"w":"Pull","s":3.3,"e":3.487},{"w":"out","s":3.487,"e":3.7},{"w":"some","s":3.7,"e":3.9},{"w":"barley","s":3.9,"e":4.375},{"w":"and","s":4.375,"e":4.5},{"w":"drop","s":4.5,"e":4.787},{"w":"it","s":4.787,"e":4.862},{"w":"on","s":4.862,"e":5.05},{"w":"purpose","s":5.05,"e":5.8},{"w":"so","s":5.912,"e":6.112},{"w":"Ruth","s":6.112,"e":6.4},{"w":"can","s":6.4,"e":6.55},{"w":"pick","s":6.55,"e":6.737},{"w":"it","s":6.737,"e":6.825},{"w":"up","s":6.825,"e":7.4}]},"handfuls-2":{"src":"audio/ruth/handfuls-2.m4a","text":"That evening, Ruth carried home a big, heavy bundle of grain. Naomi’s eyes grew wide. “Who was so kind to you?”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.6,"words":[{"w":"That","s":0.6,"e":0.787},{"w":"evening","s":0.787,"e":1.25},{"w":"Ruth","s":1.363,"e":1.625},{"w":"carried","s":1.625,"e":1.975},{"w":"home","s":1.975,"e":2.25},{"w":"a","s":2.25,"e":2.362},{"w":"big","s":2.362,"e":2.65},{"w":"heavy","s":2.7,"e":3},{"w":"bundle","s":3,"e":3.337},{"w":"of","s":3.337,"e":3.425},{"w":"grain","s":3.425,"e":4.15},{"w":"Naomi's","s":4.325,"e":4.912},{"w":"eyes","s":4.912,"e":5.3},{"w":"grew","s":5.3,"e":5.537},{"w":"wide","s":5.537,"e":6.3},{"w":"Who","s":6.525,"e":6.65},{"w":"was","s":6.65,"e":6.812},{"w":"so","s":6.812,"e":7.062},{"w":"kind","s":7.062,"