 you think she did? Boaz dropped barley on purpose so Ruth could find it. What are some quiet ways we can be kind? Who is someone you can stick with and help, like Ruth did? Our memory verse is Ruth 1, verse 16. For wherever you go, I will go, and wherever you live, I will live; your people will be my people, and your God will be my God.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":25.75,"words":[{"w":"Let's","s":0.6,"e":0.825},{"w":"talk","s":0.825,"e":1.062},{"w":"about","s":1.062,"e":1.35},{"w":"it","s":1.35,"e":1.825},{"w":"Ruth","s":1.975,"e":2.25},{"w":"could","s":2.25,"e":2.362},{"w":"have","s":2.362,"e":2.475},{"w":"gone","s":2.475,"e":2.725},{"w":"back","s":2.725,"e":2.975},{"w":"home","s":2.975,"e":3.3},{"w":"but","s":3.337,"e":3.475},{"w":"she","s":3.475,"e":3.638},{"w":"stayed","s":3.638,"e":3.938},{"w":"with","s":3.938,"e":4.075},{"w":"Naomi","s":4.075,"e":5.025},{"w":"Why","s":5.188,"e":5.338},{"w":"do","s":5.338,"e":5.438},{"w":"you","s":5.438,"e":5.525},{"w":"think","s":5.525,"e":5.725},{"w":"she","s":5.725,"e":5.875},{"w":"did","s":5.875,"e":6.425},{"w":"Boaz","s":6.588,"e":6.95},{"w":"dropped","s":6.95,"e":7.3},{"w":"barley","s":7.3,"e":7.662},{"w":"on","s":7.662,"e":7.775},{"w":"purpose","s":7.775,"e":8.25},{"w":"so","s":8.25,"e":8.425},{"w":"Ruth","s":8.425,"e":8.65},{"w":"could","s":8.65,"e":8.825},{"w":"find","s":8.825,"e":9.15},{"w":"it","s":9.15,"e":9.6},{"w":"What","s":9.7,"e":9.838},{"w":"are","s":9.838,"e":9.925},{"w":"some","s":9.925,"e":10.113},{"w":"quiet","s":10.113,"e":10.525},{"w":"ways","s":10.525,"e":10.85},{"w":"we","s":10.85,"e":10.95},{"w":"can","s":10.95,"e":11.062},{"w":"be","s":11.062,"e":11.213},{"w":"kind","s":11.213,"e":11.95},{"w":"Who","s":12.075,"e":12.225},{"w":"is","s":12.225,"e":12.35},{"w":"someone","s":12.35,"e":12.637},{"w":"you","s":12.637,"e":12.725},{"w":"can","s":12.725,"e":12.912},{"w":"stick","s":12.912,"e":13.2},{"w":"with","s":13.2,"e":13.425},{"w":"and","s":13.425,"e":13.55},{"w":"help","s":13.55,"e":13.85},{"